  "description": "ND Observability Framework provides unified logging, tracing, and metrics\n\t\t\tcapabilities for .NET microservices using Serilog, OpenTelemetry, and\n\t\t\tdistributed tracing decorators. The framework simplifies instrumentation\n\t\t\tby offering pluggable logger services, trace interceptors, correlation ID\n\t\t\tpropagation, and out-of-the-box exporters for Loki, PostgreSQL, OTLP and Azure.",
  "id": "ND.FW.Observability",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-02-04T13:19:41.51Z",
  "listed": true,
  "packageHash": "LB9zMjhYdYH1NoYLsIIOCkwOJBS8YgxM3a5JOkz97+Yq7wqm9iHqctXjdVIjvnGCPPg0ClSGsDR7FC+rf8+SpA==",
  "packageHashAlgorithm": "SHA512",
  "packageSize": 37891,
  "published": "2026-02-04T13:16:37.44Z",
  "releaseNotes": "Introduces unified logging, metrics, and tracing for .NET services.\n\t\t\tAdds INDLoggerService with structured logs and enriched metadata.\n\t\t\tProvides HTTP request metrics: count, latency, inflight, and errors.\n\t\t\tIncludes INDMetricService for custom application metrics.\n\t\t\tAdds distributed tracing with automatic span creation and correlation ID support.\n\t\t\tOffers configuration-based control for enabling logs, metrics, and traces.\n\t\t\tIncludes middleware and extension methods for quick integration.",
  "repository": "",
